Author: loop-bench <loop-bench@localhost>
Date:   Sat Nov 7 05:58:57 2026 +0100

    feat(transport): answer list_sessions over the socket

    A list_sessions frame is validated, answered with session_list off the
    per-session lock, for the user on the session: listFor is called with
    session.userId and the frame's limit and before, Dates serialised to ISO
    strings; no listFor answers empty and a failing one answers SERVER_ERROR
    with a ws error log.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Refs re-cinq/HALEngine#144

